OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are the rules for drones in
OL,4,AChannel Islands?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter unauthorised drone activity
OL,7,Fcaused flight cancellations in Jersey,
OL,8,Fauthorities say they are reviewing what
OL,9,Fcan be done to prepare for the future.
OL,11,FFlights were affected on Friday and
OL,12,FSaturday evening at the island's
OL,13,Fairport, causing major disruption, and
OL,14,Fpolice said an investigation was under
OL,15,Fway.
OL,17,FThere is increasing use of small
OL,18,Funmanned aircraft, also known as
OL,19,Fdrones, for filming, photography and
OL,20,Flight displays, but strict rules were
OL,21,Fplace to keep airspace and maritime
OL,22,Fspace safe and functional.
